  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Meteorite..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "What exactly did Jessica see...? Were you with her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...It's better if you don't find out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "It has nothing to do with our combat operations... so don't worry about it right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "How long are you going to keep hiding, Rhodes Island insects?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "(...! Mephisto! Did he find us?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "(Don't make any noises. Not yet. It's just another one of his tricks.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Aww, still don't feel like coming out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Don't think I didn't see your reinforcements coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Well, whatever. I have something to show you. I'm sure you'll like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Looking back now... We were originally planning to take over Chernobog from the very beginning..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "We waited for so, so long... and finally our time has come..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "The moment when we take our revenge against Ursus! Against those who persecuted us Infected!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "But, what about the fellows in this sub-city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "They ran away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "They had pretty quick reactions. Ran away before we had a chance to take action."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Disconnected themselves, and took off as quickly as they could--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "But where did they hope to escape to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Our comrades had long permeated every district, waiting for our opportunity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "In the end, we caught up to them, and gave them the punishment they deserved."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "These cowards, these perpetrators; what were we to do with them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "It's simple - we would make an example of them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "A proclamation that all injustices against the Infected would be purged..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "...Yes, that is the symbol of the Reunion Movement..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Let them all turn into effigies of terror, one by one!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "You, set that nearby effigy on fire! Let there be light!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Yessir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Come, light up this entire city! Let Rhodes Island see what happens to all of these cowardly oppressors!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "(--Don't!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(Quickly cover Amiya's eyes)",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor...? !"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Don't look!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
          "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
          "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
          "text": "It's... a burning hellscape of malevolence and madness..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor, let go of me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I'm fine."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...No, you must let me see it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "One day, I must hold him accountable for his actions. Besides, I used to..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(Let go of her)",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Jessica",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Why... Why..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Meteorite",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Jessica, calm down."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Meteorite",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "--That bastard!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...This is too atrocious..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "The smell of burning flesh..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "... ..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "How long to you intend to keep hiding, my dear rabbit of Chernobog?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "I saw your little rabble sneaking around earlier, so I thought you might've been up to something."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "But turns out, you're just here to enjoy the show... How boring."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "Looks like you brought an entire party with you?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Did you do all this?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "Of course~"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "Without using some terror tactics, how else were we supposed to minimize the losses?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "Make an example out of these ten percent..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "...and the other ninety percent fall into line."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "This, you see, can be considered the best way of saving lives."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...Doctor."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I am not the same person I was back then.."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Even though you might not remember..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Yes... Back then, I was timid, fragile, and easily scared... I couldn't move forward without you..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I might even look the same way right now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But the difference is, I've now seen more than enough tragedies."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I don't want to see something like this happen ever again."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...But nothing will change unless I face reality!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "After all, I have to remind myself."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I can't afford to retreat..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I have to continue to fight on!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
